{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "washtenaw-project-driveschedule",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.62: the PROJECT-domain input database of `project-driveschedule` (runspecs/), over `onroad/default-database.esm` like `inputs/washtenaw-project.esm`, whose description says what a domain document declares and why only that.\n\nmoves.rs builds it from `characterization/county-inputs/washtenaw-project-driveschedule/setup-project-driveschedule.sql`: `washtenaw-project-links`' SQL with three on-network links, two of which carry a USER DRIVE SCHEDULE in driveScheduleSecondLink, which tools/build-scale-input-db.py writes to `inputs/washtenaw-project-driveschedule/`. LinkOperatingModeDistributionGenerator walks a scheduled link second by second (step 100's first arm, `lsl_walksSchedule`) and writes the schedule's average speed into Link (`run_linkAvgSpeed`). No user operating modes.\n\nIT DOES NOT LOAD ALONE: it names no runspec.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "onroad",
      "domain",
      "project-domain",
      "scale-input-database"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_link": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-driveschedule/Link.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_link"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope",
          "output",
          "domain"
        ],
        "note": "The project's Link: 3 rows in county 26161, zone 261610 -- link 1 on road type 5 (0.3 mi, 700 veh/h, stated 30 mph, grade 0; its schedule averages 21.1 mph), links 2 and 3 on road type 4 (0.4 mi, 900 veh/h, stated 45 mph, grade 3, its schedule averaging 50.8 mph; 1.0 mi, 1,500 veh/h at 55 mph, grade 0, no schedule). Link 3 is the location after the run's two road types (`n_projectExtraLinks` 1). Links 1 and 2 are walked, so they take no grade slot and the bracketing chain walks one (`n_projectGrade` 1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_linksourcetypehour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-driveschedule/linkSourceTypeHour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_linksourcetypehour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "activity"
        ],
        "note": "6 rows: links 1-3 are 85/15, 80/20 and 75/25 percent source types 21 and 62.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_offnetworklink": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-driveschedule/offNetworkLink.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_offnetworklink"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "activity"
        ],
        "note": "2 rows in zone 261610: 1,000 passenger cars and 50 long-haul trucks. The run selects no off-network road type, so nothing reads them.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_opmodedistribution": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-driveschedule/OpModeDistribution.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_opmodedistribution"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "operating-mode"
        ],
        "note": "0 rows: the user states no operating modes, so LinkOperatingModeDistributionGenerator computes every link's -- by walking links 1 and 2's schedules and bracketing link 3.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_driveschedulesecondlink": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-driveschedule/driveScheduleSecondLink.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_driveschedulesecondlink"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "operating-mode"
        ],
        "note": "177 rows: the user's drive schedules. Link 1, 110 seconds: a signal approach decelerating from 32 mph to a stop, 22 seconds stopped, a creep below 1 mph, acceleration to a 35 mph cruise and a slowdown to 25, level. Link 2, 67 seconds: an on-ramp merge from 27 mph with a hard brake in its second second, acceleration up grades of 4, 3 and 2 percent onto the mainline at 0.5 percent, seconds 41-43 missing (a logger dropout), a slowdown to 52.6 mph. LinkOperatingModeDistributionGenerator walks each (`lsec_*`, `lsl_*`).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
